<title>GERMANY: Fielmann H1 net profit down 14.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Fielmann H1 net profit down 14.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   24.4    vs 28.7</p>
<p>    Group sales				  422.1   vs 379.4</p>
<p>    Group external sales		     521.9   vs 462.3</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    5,832   vs 5,212</p>
<p>    Group investments			  30.9    vs 41.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German spectacle maker is Fielmann AG.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
